OL,3,GNEWSAFirst section of collapsed bridge 
OL,4,Aremoved ahead of repairs               
OL,6,FThe first of three sections of a bridge
OL,7,Fthat collapsed into a harbour has been 
OL,8,Fhoisted onto a barge ahead of attempts 
OL,9,Fto repair it.                          
OL,11,FPero's Bridge fell into Bristol Harbour
OL,12,Fon 31 October after previously         
OL,13,Fsuffering a mechanical failure during a
OL,14,Ftest lift in August. No-one was        
OL,15,Finjured.                               
OL,17,FWorkers have spent the day lifting part
OL,18,Fof the bridge onto the barge using a   
OL,19,Flarge crane that was brought to the    
OL,20,Farea on Saturday.                      
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
