OL,3,GNEWSAFirst section of collapsed bridge 
OL,4,Aremoved ahead of repairs               
OL,6,FBristol City Council said all three    
OL,7,Fsections of the bridge would be        
OL,8,Ftransported down the floating harbour  
OL,9,Fto Albion Dry Dock on Tuesday, where   
OL,10,Fthey would undergo assessment and      
OL,11,Frepairs.                               
